abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline, publication figures, and interactive 3D
  visualization for Martian crustal magnetic field data from MGS
  and MAVEN missions, with a systematic review of hypomagnetic
  field effects on terrestrial biology and biological risk assessment
  for future Mars surface exploration and habitats.
